WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.457
Machine translation engines
and LLMs treat each request on

2
00:00:04.457 --> 00:00:07.347
its own, so terms
drift between pages.

3
00:00:07.747 --> 00:00:10.127
Short strings carry little context,

4
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:12.612
each surface often
uses its own tool,

5
00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:14.445
and case endings change the word.

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.111
General Translation applies a
shared Glossary through Context

7
00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:18.644
Groups.

8
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.260
A Context Group holds each term with
its definition and a translation

9
00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.385
for each locale.

10
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.391
The same groups
apply to &lt;T&gt; content,

11
00:00:28.391 --> 00:00:31.896
CLI files, and Locadex translations.

12
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.949
Wrap values such as names in &lt;Var&gt;,

13
00:00:34.949 --> 00:00:36.805
and they are never
sent for translation.

14
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.238
Your team now ships
German with each release.
